shader-slang provides CMake targets:

    find_package(slang CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE slang::slang)

The compiler driver is an imported executable of the same package:

    add_custom_command(COMMAND slang::slangc <source> -target spirv -o <out>)

Include as:

    #include <slang.h>

Only release binaries are installed. The imported targets name them for a
Debug configuration too, so a Debug link searches one directory for Slang.
